# Product-naming allowlist (shim paths only). Format: path-glob<TAB>regex
# Approved customer-facing name: Metrum AI Bench CLI (short form: Bench CLI).
# Binary/crate names remain metrum-ai-bench. Exceptions below cover legacy shims.
Cargo.toml	name = "metrumbench|path = "src/bin/metrumbench
src/bin/metrumbench*	.
README.md	metrumbench-\*|deprecated `metrumbench|shim will be removed|removed in v2\.0
docs/**	metrumbench-\*|shim will be removed|removed in v2\.0|deprecated shim
.gitignore	metrumbench-imagegen-artifacts
scripts/live/**	metrumbench
